        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jofonji ma twodo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotuci wac ma twodo cango jobedo i dier ji pa Were, paka bende jolabino i dier win. Jobino rwako fonji ma kelo rerok, aka jobino kwedere kwoŋ Rwoth jadhum m'onyewo jo, to jokelo tho kwoŋ gin abwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jomathoth jobino mako royo pajo ma wickwot; aka ro tim pajo, jobino luwo marac kwoŋ Royo Mar'adieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I woro pajo, jofonji ma twodo me jobino cemo kwoŋ win gi kigana ma wegi jocwogo. Banja pajo otiek yiko thumo wok con, aka rerok pajo bende ki nibor to nicegin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'inen Were k'oworo jomalaika ma cango jotimo gimarac to obolo jo i mac makitho kam'otwey'iye jo i mudho, ka jokuro ndelo ma thumo banja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Cak 6:1—7:24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odoko Were k'oworo piny macon, to okelo mikula madwoŋ ri joreco, to gwoko nyaka Nowa m'ofonjo tiro, kodi ji man abirio kende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 19:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Were othumo banja ri tindi ma Sodom kodi Gomora, munyo waŋo woko jo gi mac, aka oloko jo ranen ri gima bino timere ri joreco je; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.1+GEN.19.2+GEN.19.3+GEN.19.4+GEN.19.5+GEN.19.6+GEN.19.7+GEN.19.8+GEN.19.9+GEN.19.10+GEN.19.11+GEN.19.12+GEN.19.13+GEN.19.14+GEN.19.15+GEN.19.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 19:1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kole go obotho Loti, ŋataber, ma cunye oramo swa kwoŋ kidakana pa ji m'oyido jokidew cik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ato jal maber no obedo i dier jo, aka kisi piny m'oyawere olimo litho i cunye munyo oneno to winjo tim pajo mareco no). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, kere Rwoth oŋeyo nger ma botho ji mabeyo ma jolworo Were i candirok ma temo jo, kodi weyo joreco i gir'acula pajo cuka ndelo ma thumo banja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodhi joma cwire i kiti jo m'otop ma kidakana aka jocayo meni pa Were.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jofonji ma twodo me jonitie gi miseni kodi mikanyo, aka joluwere kicar kwoŋ cwec manitie i hongo malo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma to kiri jomalaika ma jotek aka jomeni loyo jokikel wac marac kwoŋ cwec no ruwaŋ Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jome joluwere kicar kwoŋ gima jokuya odoco. Jocale g'ogwaŋe madudi ma jongoye gi paro, m'imako t'ineko jo, ilareyo jo woko paka ogwaŋe madudi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilaculo jo candirok ro candirok ma jotieko kelo ri joman. Kisangala pajo obedo medho odieceŋ ma siemo delkwoŋ gin. Bedo giwickwot kendo gimarac ka jobedo dhower gi win, kareno josangala i royo pajo mareco! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi waŋ gin ma neno gimoro gi cot, jogomba kisi dhako ma joneno. Awanya pajo ma timo gimarac kikwe; jodwoŋo joma nyap, aka joŋiyo timo woro. Jobedo ji m'otiek kwoŋo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.22.4+NUM.22.5+NUM.22.6+NUM.22.7+NUM.22.8+NUM.22.9+NUM.22.10+NUM.22.11+NUM.22.12+NUM.22.13+NUM.22.14+NUM.22.15+NUM.22.16+NUM.22.17+NUM.22.18+NUM.22.19+NUM.22.20+NUM.22.21+NUM.22.22+NUM.22.23+NUM.22.24+NUM.22.25+NUM.22.26+NUM.22.27+NUM.22.28+NUM.22.29+NUM.22.30+NUM.22.31+NUM.22.32+NUM.22.33+NUM.22.34+NUM.22.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwan 22:4-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joweyo royo m'otire to jorwenyo munyo jomako royo ma Balam wod pa Beyor oluwo, m'onwaŋo omaro pesa ma go olimo i timo reco, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to punda pere oay kwoŋe ro reco pere. Gino oluwo gi dwondi dhano to juko tim pa jatuci wac ma janeko no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jome jocale waŋ pi m'odwono kodi pondeponde ma koyo waro; Were oyiko rijo kama dimudho tektek maloyo kaman je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joluwo wac ma miŋo gi pakirok, aka jooro awanya ma delkwoŋ gin ma ciko joma nyaka joeye kwoŋ joma nitie i royo ma kelo rwenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jociko jo siem ma to wegi jobedo ŋecin pa kite mareco; ato dhano bedo ŋeca pa gima dhumo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole k'inen oyido jotieko budhirok kwoŋ meni ma piny ma kelo tho, to joŋeyo Rwodhiwan kendo Jaboth mawan Yesu Kristo, aka odoko jomoko kendo i meni no to nyalo jo, meno kere nyutho ni jonitie marac rumacen loyo kacako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'ober rijo ka jobedo ma jokuya royo ma tiro loyo ŋeyo royo no to odoko joweyo cik maleŋ m'omiy jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Agec 26:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gim'otimere gi jo nyutho ni ageca me otire ni, “Gwok odoko gik naŋo ŋok pere kendo aka mbiji m'otiek lwoko odoko gik ŋindirok i cwodho kendo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
